  "notes": [
    "**Jugar** is a stem-changing verb: u→ue (the only verb with this pattern!)",
    "Present: stem change u→ue (except nosotros)",
    "Preterite: spelling change g→gu before é (jugué), NO stem change",
    "Imperfect: regular -AR pattern, NO stem change",
    "Pretérito Perfecto: regular past participle **jugado**",
    "Future: regular future endings attached to infinitive",
    "Condicional: regular conditional endings attached to infinitive",
    "Used with sports/games: *jugar al fútbol* (to play soccer), *jugar videojuegos* (to play video games)",
    "Unique: only Spanish verb with u→ue stem change",
    "Related noun: **el juego** (game), **el/la jugador/jugadora** (player)"
  ],
